{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261021/photo/bkn-20261021131626277-1021_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261021142725\"/><p>人員帶走一名男子。(馬竟峯攝)</p><p>中環有人行使偽鈔。今午(21日)12時53分，金融街8號國際金融中心二期一滙豐銀行職員報案，指有一名內地漢到上址以7張1000港元鈔票開戶口，惟鈔票懷疑為偽鈔。警員接報到場經初步調查後，以「行使偽製紙幣」拘捕該名年約70歲的內地漢。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T06:36:20.887184+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T05:16:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T08:37:55.856312+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T06:34:12.710149+00:00","content_hash":"27aaebb1522b068d468d9377a200c819b5fbf365568bc1ef844749640778f640","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}